[26.554085, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u2580\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u2580\u2584\u2580\u2588 \u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u2580\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u2580\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u2580 \u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u2588\u2584\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[2mv0.7.4\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mModel: claude-haiku-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ami-demo-sRHDi2\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-165436-744-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Create a file called stats.py that reads numbers from a file called data.txt, computes the mean \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mand median, and prints them. Then create data.txt with the contents: 10 20 thirty 40 50. Run \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mstats.py \u2014 it will crash. Diagnose the traceback, fix the root cause in stats.py so it gracefully \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mkips non-numeric values, and re-run it to show the correct output. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll complete this step by step.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K## Step 1: Create stats\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[18G\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u0